{"id": "20499620", "revid": "753665", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20499620", "title": "Gilmar (footballer, born 1973)", "text": "Gilmar Lobato da Rocha (born 17 October 1973 in Natal, Rio Grande do Norte), known simply as Gilmar, is a Brazilian retired footballer who played as a central midfielder. He also held Portuguese citizenship, due to the many years spent in the country (14 seasons in representation of four teams).\nIn Portugal's Primeira Liga, Gilmar amassed totals of 142 games and five goals, with Varzim SC (two seasons) and Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Naval 1\u00ba de Maio (five, even though he did not appear in his last one)."}
